Typing, new cells at the insertion point, line breaks, deletion and undo (design 2.7, 3.2, 3.5).

=== typing at the insertion point creates an Input cell
--- before
‖
--- keys
"1+1"
--- after
#% cell
1+1▮

=== a cell typed between two Text cells is an Input cell
--- before
#% text
# a

‖
#% text
# b
--- keys
"x"
--- after
#% text
# a

#% cell
x▮

#% text
# b

=== a cell typed after a section joins the section
--- before
#% section
# S

#% text
# t

‖
--- keys
"y"
--- after
#% section
# S

#% text
# t

#% cell
y▮
--- groups
{S t y}

=== Alt+digit at an insertion point sets the style typing creates
--- before
‖
--- keys
Alt+4 "Intro"
--- after
#% section
# Intro▮

=== Return in an Input cell is a line break
--- before
#% cell
f(x▮
--- keys
Enter "y"
--- after
#% cell
f(x
y▮

=== Return in a Title or Section is a line break in the same cell
--- before
#% title
# Big▮
--- keys
Enter "Two"
--- after
#% title
# Big
# Two▮

=== Return at the end of an Item creates a new Item
--- before
#% item
# first▮
--- keys
Enter "second"
--- after
#% item
# first

#% item
# second▮

=== Return inside an Item moves the rest into the new Item
--- before
#% item
# ab▮cd
--- keys
Enter
--- after
#% item
# ab

#% item
# ▮cd

=== quotes in prose become curly, in input they stay straight
--- before
#% text
# ▮
--- keys
"say \"hi\" it's"
--- after
#% text
# say “hi” it’s▮

=== quotes in input stay straight
--- before
#% cell
▮
--- keys
"\"a\""
--- after
#% cell
"a"▮

=== Backspace and Delete
--- before
#% cell
ab▮cd
--- keys
Backspace Delete
--- after
#% cell
a▮d

=== Backspace at the start of a cell does nothing
--- before
#% cell
a

#% cell
▮b
--- keys
Backspace
--- after
#% cell
a

#% cell
▮b

=== Ctrl+Backspace deletes a word
--- before
#% cell
alpha + beta▮
--- keys
Ctrl+Backspace
--- after
#% cell
alpha + ▮

=== typing replaces a text selection
--- before
#% cell
a⟦bc⟧d
--- keys
"X"
--- after
#% cell
aX▮d

=== undo of typing is one unit per run
--- before
#% cell
▮
--- keys
"abc" Ctrl+Z
--- after
#% cell
▮

=== a pause ends a typing run
--- before
#% cell
▮
--- keys
"ab" Pause "cd" Ctrl+Z
--- after
#% cell
ab▮

=== a word after white space starts a new undo unit
--- before
#% cell
▮
--- keys
"ab cd" Ctrl+Z
--- after
#% cell
ab ▮

=== undo of a cell created by typing removes the cell; redo brings it back
--- before
#% text
# t

‖
--- keys
"x" Ctrl+Z
--- after
#% text
# t

‖

=== redo after undo
--- before
‖
--- keys
"x" Ctrl+Z Ctrl+Y
--- after
#% cell
x▮

=== a new edit clears redo
--- before
#% cell
▮
--- keys
"a" Ctrl+Z "b" Ctrl+Y
--- after
#% cell
b▮

=== Tab indents, Shift+Tab outdents
--- before
#% cell
⟦a
b⟧
--- keys
Tab
--- after
#% cell
    ⟦a
    b⟧

=== Shift+Tab outdents the selected lines
--- before
#% cell
    ⟦a
    b⟧
--- keys
Shift+Tab
--- after
#% cell
⟦a
b⟧

=== typing with cells selected does nothing
--- before
#% cell ◆
a
--- keys
"x"
--- after
#% cell ◆
a

=== Message cells are not editable
--- before
#% cell
1 +
#% output
#! error▮
--- keys
"x"
--- after
#% cell
1 +
#% output
#! error▮

=== Ctrl+A selects the cell's content, then all cells
--- before
#% cell
a▮b

#% cell
c
--- keys
Ctrl+A
--- after
#% cell
⟦ab⟧

#% cell
c

=== a second Ctrl+A selects every cell
--- before
#% cell
a▮b

#% cell
c
--- keys
Ctrl+A Ctrl+A
--- after
#% cell ◆
ab

#% cell ◆
c

=== the reserved keys do nothing
--- before
#% cell
a▮
--- keys
Ctrl+9 Ctrl+J F7 Ctrl+/
--- after
#% cell
a▮

=== Esc name Esc inserts the alias's character
--- before
#% cell
x = ▮
--- keys
Esc "a" Esc " + " Esc "inf" Esc " " Esc "->" Esc
--- after
#% cell
x = α + ∞ →▮

=== an unknown alias stays marked
--- before
#% cell
▮
--- keys
Esc "nosuch" Esc
--- after
#% cell
⋮nosuch▮

=== Backspace after the marker removes it
--- before
#% text
# a▮
--- keys
Esc Backspace "b"
--- after
#% text
# ab▮

=== Alt+/ comments the selected lines of an input
--- before
#% cell
⟦a = 1
b⟧ = 2
--- keys
Alt+/
--- after
#% cell
⟦# a = 1
# b⟧ = 2

=== Alt+/ again uncomments them
--- before
#% cell
⟦# a = 1
# b⟧ = 2
--- keys
Alt+/
--- after
#% cell
⟦a = 1
b⟧ = 2

=== Alt+/ with a caret comments its line
--- before
#% cell
x
y▮
--- keys
Alt+/
--- after
#% cell
x
# y▮

=== Ctrl+. from inside a name selects the name, then the enclosing expressions (design 3.4)
--- before
#% cell
f(a▮a + b*c, d)
--- keys
Ctrl+.
--- after
#% cell
f(⟦aa⟧ + b*c, d)

=== Ctrl+. after b selects the product, then outwards to the cell
--- before
#% cell
f(aa + b▮*c, d)
--- keys
Ctrl+. Ctrl+. Ctrl+. Ctrl+. Ctrl+. Ctrl+.
--- after
#% cell ◆
f(aa + b*c, d)

=== Ctrl+. in text selects the content, then the cell
--- before
#% text
# some▮ words
--- keys
Ctrl+.
--- after
#% text
# ⟦some words⟧

=== Ctrl+Shift+B selects the brackets around the caret, then the next ones out
--- before
#% cell
f(g(x▮), y)
--- keys
Ctrl+Shift+B Ctrl+Shift+B
--- after
#% cell
f⟦(g(x), y)⟧

=== Esc with a text selection does nothing
--- before
#% cell
a⟦bc⟧
--- keys
Esc
--- after
#% cell
a⟦bc⟧
